\toprule
\textbf{ID} & \textbf{Case} & \textbf{L1 (CLI)} & \textbf{L2 (wire)} & \textbf{L3 (state)} \\
\midrule
\endfirsthead
\toprule
\textbf{ID} & \textbf{Case} & \textbf{L1} & \textbf{L2} & \textbf{L3} \\
\midrule
\endhead
P1-A1 & \texttt{web\_app new shop} creates project & exit 0; stdout ``created at \dots'' & --- & \texttt{\textasciitilde/.easynet/web-apps/shop/easynet.app.toml} + \texttt{package.json} exist \\
P1-A2 & toml has required keys & parse OK & --- & toml \texttt{[manifest].name == "shop"} \\
P1-A3 & toml missing required key rejected & exit $\neq$ 0; stderr names missing key & --- & project dir not created (or rolled back) \\
P1-B1 & \texttt{web\_app build shop} runs npm build & exit 0; stdout ``built in \(N\)ms'' & --- & \texttt{dist/index.html} exists, size \(>0\) \\
P1-B2 & build failure (vite forced error) & exit $\neq$ 0; stderr has vite output & --- & no new \texttt{dist/}; previous \texttt{dist/} unchanged \\
P1-B3 & build writes a receipt & --- & --- & \texttt{receipt\_store} contains one entry: \texttt{ability=<owner>.web\_app.build}, \texttt{subject=resource/web\_app.alice.shop}, \texttt{outcome=success} \\
P1-C1 & \texttt{web\_app serve shop} starts axum & exit 0; stdout ``serving at http://127.0.0.1:\(p\)'' & \texttt{curl http://127.0.0.1:\(p\)/} 200, \texttt{Content-Type: text/html} & \texttt{lsof -iTCP -sTCP:LISTEN} shows daemon owns port \(p\) \\
P1-C2 & \texttt{GET /assets/index-*.js} & --- & 200; \texttt{Content-Type: application/javascript}; ETag header & served bytes \texttt{sha256} match \texttt{dist/assets/} on disk \\
P1-C3 & \texttt{POST /api/papers.list} & --- & 200; JSON body matches papers folder & daemon log: \texttt{invoke\_local\_ability(papers.list)} \\
P1-C4 & \texttt{POST /api/<undeclared>} & --- & 404 (not 403) & no \texttt{invoke} attempted; router refused \\
P1-C5 & ability panics inside invocation & --- & 500; JSON \texttt{\{error: \dots\}} & \texttt{receipt\_store} has \texttt{outcome=failure} entry \\
P1-D1 & \texttt{web\_app stop shop} & exit 0 & next \texttt{curl} → connection refused & port released \\
P1-D2 & \texttt{web\_app delete shop} & exit 0 & --- & project dir gone; \texttt{Resource} row gone; receipts retained \\
P1-E1 & \textbf{e2e}: papers viewer end-to-end via Playwright headless Chrome & --- & Playwright: open \texttt{/web/alice/papers/}; click an item; right pane shows summary returned by \texttt{/api/papers.summarize} & receipts: \(\geq 1\) \texttt{web\_app.build} + \(\geq 1\) \texttt{papers.summarize} \\
