\section{Implementation plan}
\label{sec:impl}

\subsection{Module map (EasyNet-Cli, Phase 1)}

\begin{lstlisting}
src/runtime/agents/web_app/                  ← NEW
  mod.rs                                     ability registration
  ability.rs                                  create / update_config /
                                              build / serve / stop /
                                              delete / get / list
  meta_schema.rs                              JSON-Schema for meta blob
  build_runner.rs                             subprocess + log capture
  axum_serve.rs                               in-daemon Hub (Phase 1)
  api_handler.rs                              /api/<verb> dispatch
  static_handler.rs                           local-FS dist/ serve

src/runtime/skills/easynet-webapp-author/    ← NEW (Phase 1 surface)
  SKILL.md
\end{lstlisting}

\subsection{EAL changes (Phase 3 only)}

\begin{lstlisting}
src/eal/cli/run.rs           ← NEW flag --cite-receipt <id>
src/eal/interpreter.rs        ← inject causal_context.Scalar on
                                first step's invocation envelope
\end{lstlisting}

\subsection{Backend (Phase 2 only)}

Backend changes are confined to:
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=2em,itemsep=0.15em]
    \item \texttt{/api/v1/web\_apps} list / get endpoints (mirror
    of \texttt{agent\_view}).
    \item \texttt{/web/<owner>/<slug>/...} reverse proxy that
    \texttt{forward\_invoke}s into the owner daemon.
    \item Frontend \texttt{parseURA.ts} kind \texttt{web\_app}
    rendering (already covered by URA v2 plan §Phase 11).
\end{itemize}

No new ent table beyond the \texttt{Resource} row delivered by
URA v2 plan §Phase 2.

